OL,3,ANaomi Campbell wins appeal over charity
OL,4,Aban
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Ms Campbell was not involved in, and
OL,7,Fdid not know of, that conduct," the
OL,8,Fthree-person tribunal panel said.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
